  "verification_method": [
    "tools/btfw.py selects and hash-verifies the pinned CYW43439 SDIO image; tests/test_btfw.py rejects truncations; tools/audit_hcd.py records the rejected UART candidate.",
    "tools/verify_build.py checks ELF/BIN/UF2 structure, UF2 family 0xe48bff59 (RP2350), the linked radio-image payload and the SHA-256 of every artifact (it does not execute firmware).",
    "All three matrix builds used the same pinned SDK, Rust toolchain and tree at base commit a0532e5.",
    "Host suite at the same tree separately passes 56/56 with native FDK (see the handoff and build-offline-evidence/summary.json in the local worktree)."
